  "description": "The Freeman 10 piece T-Handle SAE hex wrench set features the most commonly used SAE hex wrench sizes needed for all of your home improvement projects. Hex wrenches, also known as Allen wrenches, are the ideal tool for removing or tightening bolts in your automotive, household, furniture, or assembly projects. Featuring a T-Handle design, each hex wrench provides a more secure grip than traditional hex wrenches do while providing maximum torque to tighten and loosen bolts with ease. The 10 piece set includes 3/23\", 7/64\", 1/8\", 9/64\", 5/32\", 3/16\", 7/32\", 1/4\", 5/16\", and 3/8\" wrenches in a convenient metal stand that can be mounted to pegboards, walls, or Benchtop work spaces. Easy to read sizes on each T-Handle and on the metal stand for Quick identification. Chamfered ends are precisely sized and burr free to insert smoothly into fastener heads, making it easier to complete your projects while preventing unnecessary wear and tear. Enjoy years of consistent performance and durability thanks to the heat treated chrome vanadium steel construction, which resists rust and corrosion.",
